  "summary": "Usable data came from Carrefour Qatar (site search and category browsing, reached via a text-rendering proxy after direct fetches were consistently blocked with 403s and timeouts) and Lulu Hypermarket Qatar product/category pages, including Agrico-brand organic herbs distributed through Carrefour. WebSearch quota was exhausted early in the task, and nearly every other Qatar grocery platform tried (Lulu's own domain directly, Ansar Gallery, Jazp, Frutzo, Snoonu, Rafeeq, Talabat storefronts) either 403'd or returned an empty JS shell with no product data, so coverage leans heavily on two retailers. Butterhead/round lettuce, edible flowers, and all four microgreens benchmarks were not found at any reachable retailer despite repeated targeted searches, including Agrico's own hydroponic-branded line (which only yielded herbs and mushrooms)."
